{"id":"vod_sn_35526","vodId":"35526","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"新蔷薇少女","name_cn":"新蔷薇少女","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/11dd9c0bb3789dbbce5c42610745e41c.jpg"},"summary":"纯（逢坂良太 配音）升上了大学，每一天，他上课下课打工，过着枯燥而乏味的生活。某日，在打工的店里，纯意外得到了一本杂志，这本杂志专门教人如何使用杂志里附赠的零件来制作人偶，只要收集齐这一套杂志，按部就班的制作，就能够得到名为真红（泽城美雪 配音）美丽人偶。　　就这样，在好奇心的趋势之下，纯开始制作人偶。可就在快要完工的节骨眼上，纯却收到了杂志休刊的消息，而这一切背后的始作俑者，是名叫雪华绮晶（千叶千惠巳 配音）的人偶。当纯开始制作真红的那一刻起，人偶之间的战争再度拉开了序幕。为了完成自己的作品，纯决定亲自前往N之领域，寻找剩下的材料。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U8ufmZQD8b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zPnGBHny1k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iNUYLj4yLV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UA31WxZJsL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nPKt3inqNQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6v153NyYXT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qFH0FcVPQY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qSdC5Zwsnv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/52CvnLKi8z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UPwpHESANA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PP2PsruxSj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i4CZC6VwYv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yEyxQRUMBH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:34.168Z"}